@startuml
skin rose
skinparam ActivityFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12

title Recording a validated undoable change

start
:Prepare the candidate and previous data
for the changed section;
:Save backup if data changed,
recovery metadata, and candidate;
if (Persistence succeeds?) then (yes)
    :Update the section's history
with at most five snapshots;
    note right
    Unchanged data adds no history entry.
    end note
    :Apply the prepared change
to the live model;
    :Return success;
else (no)
    :Report error without changing
live data or existing history;
endif
stop
@enduml
